@startuml ChatFlow

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title
    AI 聊天助手交互流程
    果蔬智造核心平台 v1.0 
end title

actor "用户" as User
participant "前端\nChatWidget" as Frontend
participant "后端\nChat Routes" as Backend
participant "LLM Client" as LLM
participant "MCP Client\n(SQLx Direct)" as MCP
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Redis\n会话缓存" as Cache
boundary "LLM API\n(SiliconFlow)" as LLMService

== 1. 会话初始化 ==

User -> Frontend: 点击聊天按钮
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/v1/chat/sessions\n{title: "新对话"}
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO chat_sessions\n(user_id, title, status='active')
activate DB
DB --> Backend: 返回 session_id
deactivate DB

Backend -> Cache: SET active_session:{user_id}\n(session_id, TTL=1h)
activate Cache
Cache --> Backend: OK
deactivate Cache

Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{session_id, created_at}
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: 初始化聊天界面\n创建 Pinia store
Frontend --> User: 显示聊天窗口
deactivate Frontend

== 2. 用户发送消息 ==

User -> Frontend: 输入问题:\n"今天上传了多少张图片?"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/v1/chat/message\n{session_id, content}
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO chat_messages\n(session_id, role='user', content)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: 确认写入
deactivate DB

Backend -> Cache: RPUSH conversation:{session_id}\n追加用户消息
activate Cache
Cache --> Backend: OK
deactivate Cache

== 3. LLM 处理与工具决策 ==

Backend -> Cache: LRANGE conversation:{session_id} -20 -1\n获取最近20条历史
activate Cache
Cache --> Backend: 返回聊天历史
deactivate Cache

Backend -> LLM: 构建请求\nsystem_prompt + history + tools
activate LLM

LLM -> LLMService: POST /v1/messages\n{model, messages, tools}
activate LLMService

LLMService -> LLMService: 分析用户意图\n识别需要查询数据库
LLMService --> LLM: 返回工具调用\ntool_use: database_query
deactivate LLMService

LLM --> Backend: tool_calls: [database_query]
deactivate LLM

== 4. MCP 执行数据库查询 ==

Backend -> MCP: execute_tool(database_query)
activate MCP

MCP -> MCP: 安全检查\n表白名单验证、SQL注入检测、关键字过滤

MCP -> DB: SQLx 执行查询\n预编译语句
activate DB
DB --> MCP: 返回结果\n[{count: 15}]
deactivate DB

MCP -> MCP: 格式化结果\n限制行数 (max: 1000)
MCP --> Backend: tool_result: {success: true, rows: [{count: 15}], row_count: 1}
deactivate MCP

== 5. LLM 生成最终回复 ==

Backend -> LLM: 发送工具结果
activate LLM

LLM -> LLMService: POST /v1/messages\n{..., tool_results}
activate LLMService

LLMService -> LLMService: 基于查询结果\n生成自然语言回复
LLMService --> LLM: 返回文本响应
deactivate LLMService

LLM --> Backend: content: "根据数据库查询，今天总共上传了 15 张图片。"
deactivate LLM

== 6. 响应持久化与返回 ==

Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO chat_messages\n(role='assistant', content, metadata)
activate DB
note right
    metadata 包含：
    • tool_calls 详情
    • 查询耗时
    • 模型信息
end note
DB --> Backend: 确认写入
deactivate DB

Backend -> Cache: RPUSH conversation:{session_id}\n追加助手消息
Backend -> Cache: LTRIM -20 (保持最近20条)
activate Cache
Cache --> Backend: OK
deactivate Cache

Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{message_id, role: 'assistant', content, tool_calls, created_at}
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: 渲染 Markdown 消息\n显示工具调用信息
Frontend --> User: 显示 AI 回复
deactivate Frontend

== 7. 轮询获取新消息（可选）==

loop 每 5 秒
    Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/v1/chat/messages/new
    activate Backend
    Backend -> Cache: LRANGE conversation:{session_id}
    activate Cache
    alt 有新消息
        Cache --> Backend: 返回新消息
        deactivate Cache
        Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK {messages: [...]} 
        Frontend -> Frontend: 更新界面
    else 无新消息
        Cache --> Backend: 空列表
        deactivate Cache
        Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK {messages: []}
    end
    deactivate Backend
end

note over User, LLMService
MCP 安全限制：
• 仅允许 SELECT 查询
• 表白名单: uploads, results, detections, chat_*
• 最大返回: 1000 行
• 查询超时: 5 秒
• SQL 注入防护

缓存策略：
• 活跃会话: TTL 1 小时
• 聊天历史: TTL 30 分钟
• 最多缓存: 20 条消息

性能指标：
• LLM 响应: 1-3 秒
• 数据库查询: < 100ms
• 总响应时间: < 5 秒
end note

@enduml
